<title>BELGIUM: CYCLING-LEADING POSITIONS IN GHENT SIX-DAY RACE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-LEADING POSITIONS IN GHENT SIX-DAY RACE.</headline>
<dateline>GHENT, Belgium 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading positions after</p>
<p>the fifth day of the Ghent six-day cycling race on Saturday:</p>
<p> 1. Bruno Risi/Kurt Betschart (Switzerland)	 402 points</p>
<p> 2. Andreas Kappes/Carsten Wolf (Germany)		    401</p>
<p>One lap behind:</p>
<p> 3. Jens Veggerby/Jimmi Madsen (Denmark)		     360</p>
<p> 4. Etienne De Wilde/Adriano Baffi (Belgium/Italy)	 354</p>
<p> 5. Silvio Martinello/Marco Villa (Italy)		    315</p>
<p>Four laps behind:</p>
<p>6. Matthew Gilmore/Jakob Piil Storm (Australia/Denmark) 288</p>
</text>
